<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="神のまにまに(カバー)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="れるりり"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="放課後のあいつ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="えるの"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Boost!"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1317282232"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:09.414"><div begin="22.801" end="4:09.414"><p begin="22.801" end="26.852" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.801" end="23.301">思</span><span begin="23.301" end="23.534">い</span><span begin="23.534" end="23.799">通</span><span begin="23.799" end="24.455">り</span><span begin="24.455" end="25.219">に いか</span><span begin="25.219" end="25.594">ない</span><span begin="25.594" end="25.800">こと</span><span begin="25.800" end="26.852">だらけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">诸事都不如心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omo i doo ri ni ika nai koto darake</span></p><p begin="26.852" end="30.094" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.852" end="27.257">どう</span><span begin="27.257" end="28.697">しようもなく</span> <span begin="28.697" end="29.481">自己嫌</span><span begin="29.481" end="30.094">悪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">自我厌恶得不行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dou siyoumonaku zikokeno</span></p><p begin="30.094" end="33.561" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="30.094" end="31.549">八百万の</span> <span begin="31.549" end="31.821">痛</span><span begin="31.821" end="32.000">み</span><span begin="32.000" end="32.211">や</span><span begin="32.211" end="32.423">悲</span><span begin="32.423" end="32.866">しみ</span><span begin="32.866" end="33.561">から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">众神皆具痛苦与悲楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yaoyorozu no ita mi ya kana simi kara</span></p><p begin="33.561" end="35.779" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="33.561" end="33.773">逃</span><span begin="33.773" end="34.452">げ込</span><span begin="34.452" end="34.902">める</span><span begin="34.902" end="35.317">場所</span><span begin="35.317" end="35.779">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我为逃脱这些</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ni ge ko meru basyo wo</span></p><p begin="35.779" end="37.249" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="35.779" end="36.196">探</span><span begin="36.196" end="36.445">し</span><span begin="36.445" end="37.249">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而寻找场所</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saga si teru</span></p><p begin="37.249" end="40.700" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.249" end="37.803">いっそ</span> <span begin="37.803" end="38.243">岩</span><span begin="38.243" end="38.621">の</span><span begin="38.621" end="39.110">隙間</span><span begin="39.110" end="39.344">に</span><span begin="39.344" end="39.619">引</span><span begin="39.619" end="40.242">きこもっ</span><span begin="40.242" end="40.700">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">干脆躲进岩石缝里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">isso iwa no sukima ni hi kikomoxtu te</span></p><p begin="40.700" end="44.266" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.700" end="42.239">月も太陽も</span><span begin="42.239" end="42.662">無視</span><span begin="42.662" end="42.888">し</span><span begin="42.888" end="43.116">て</span> <span begin="43.116" end="43.562">眠</span><span begin="43.562" end="43.758">ろ</span><span begin="43.758" end="44.266">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无视太阳月亮大睡一场</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tuki mo taiyou mo musi si te nemu ro u</span></p><p begin="44.266" end="47.769" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.266" end="44.561">生</span><span begin="44.561" end="44.901">まれ</span><span begin="44.901" end="45.384">て</span><span begin="45.384" end="45.704">き</span><span begin="45.704" end="45.834">た</span><span begin="45.834" end="46.192">こと</span><span begin="46.192" end="46.576">の</span> <span begin="46.576" end="46.875">意味</span><span begin="46.875" end="47.769">なんて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的诞生有何意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">u mare te ki ta koto no imi nante</span></p><p begin="47.769" end="51.264" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.769" end="48.013">知</span><span begin="48.013" end="48.193">ら</span><span begin="48.193" end="48.968">ない</span> <span begin="48.968" end="49.326">分</span><span begin="49.326" end="49.759">かん</span><span begin="49.759" end="50.028">ない</span><span begin="50.028" end="51.264">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不知道也不知晓啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">si ra nai wa kan nai yo</span></p><p begin="51.264" end="56.622" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="51.264" end="52.232">でも</span> <span begin="52.232" end="52.856">そんな</span><span begin="52.856" end="52.958">風</span><span begin="52.958" end="53.328">に</span> <span begin="53.328" end="53.775">思</span><span begin="53.775" end="54.933">える</span><span begin="54.933" end="55.208">って</span><span begin="55.208" end="56.622">こと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但就是因为你能这样思考</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo sonna huu ni omo eru tte koto</span></p><p begin="56.622" end="1:02.715" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="56.622" end="56.931">それ</span><span begin="56.931" end="58.455">は</span> <span begin="58.455" end="58.915">君</span><span begin="58.915" end="59.167">が</span><span begin="59.167" end="59.648">もっと</span><span begin="59.648" end="1:00.039">もっと</span><span begin="1:00.039" end="1:00.456">素敵</span><span begin="1:00.456" end="1:00.760">に</span> <span begin="1:00.760" end="1:01.253">な</span><span begin="1:01.253" end="1:01.731">れる</span><span begin="1:01.731" end="1:02.224">力</span><span begin="1:02.224" end="1:02.715">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">才意味着你能拥有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore ha kimi ga motto motto suteki ni na reru tikara ga</span></p><p begin="1:02.715" end="1:08.428" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:02.715" end="1:03.176">ある</span><span begin="1:03.176" end="1:04.164">って</span> <span begin="1:04.164" end="1:04.521">教</span><span begin="1:04.521" end="1:04.840">え</span><span begin="1:04.840" end="1:05.515">てる</span><span begin="1:05.515" end="1:08.428">んだよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">能让你越来越强大的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aru tte osi e teru n da yo</span></p><p begin="1:08.428" end="1:09.665" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.428" end="1:09.665">そうさ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa</span></p><p begin="1:09.665" end="1:11.549" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.665" end="1:10.264">神</span><span begin="1:10.264" end="1:10.627">の</span> <span begin="1:10.627" end="1:11.549">まにまに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随神之侧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no manimani</span></p><p begin="1:11.549" end="1:13.349" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.549" end="1:11.880">仰</span><span begin="1:11.880" end="1:12.022">せ</span><span begin="1:12.022" end="1:12.644">の まま</span><span begin="1:12.644" end="1:13.349">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">听神之命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oo se no mama ni</span></p><p begin="1:13.349" end="1:17.009" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.349" end="1:13.761">誰</span><span begin="1:13.761" end="1:14.049">だって</span> <span begin="1:14.049" end="1:15.090">地球を</span><span begin="1:15.090" end="1:15.426">愛</span><span begin="1:15.426" end="1:15.774">し</span><span begin="1:15.774" end="1:17.009">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">大家都深爱着地球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare datte tikyuu wo ai si teru</span></p><p begin="1:17.009" end="1:18.797" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.009" end="1:17.263">飲</span><span begin="1:17.263" end="1:17.395">め</span><span begin="1:17.395" end="1:18.013">や 歌</span><span begin="1:18.013" end="1:18.245">え</span><span begin="1:18.245" end="1:18.797">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喝酒欢歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">no me ya uta e ya</span></p><p begin="1:18.797" end="1:20.518" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.797" end="1:19.726">どんちゃん</span> <span begin="1:19.726" end="1:19.985">騒</span><span begin="1:19.985" end="1:20.518">ぎ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随意吵闹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dontyan sawa gi</span></p><p begin="1:20.518" end="1:22.242" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.518" end="1:20.896">たま</span><span begin="1:20.896" end="1:21.282">にゃ</span> <span begin="1:21.282" end="1:21.736">そんな</span><span begin="1:21.736" end="1:22.063">の</span><span begin="1:22.063" end="1:22.242">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">偶尔这样子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tama nya sonna no mo</span></p><p begin="1:22.242" end="1:23.595" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.242" end="1:23.595">いいね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也不错呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iine</span></p><p begin="1:23.595" end="1:25.799" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.595" end="1:24.047">そうさ</span> <span begin="1:24.047" end="1:24.860">北も</span><span begin="1:24.860" end="1:25.799">南も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊 无论南北</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa kita mo minami mo</span></p><p begin="1:25.799" end="1:27.527" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.799" end="1:26.654">右も</span> <span begin="1:26.654" end="1:27.527">左も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论左右</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">migi mo hidari mo</span></p><p begin="1:27.527" end="1:31.127" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.527" end="1:28.492">なんだかんだ</span> <span begin="1:28.492" end="1:29.338">地球を</span><span begin="1:29.338" end="1:29.713">愛</span><span begin="1:29.713" end="1:30.010">し</span><span begin="1:30.010" end="1:31.127">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">大家都深爱着地球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nandakanda tikyuu wo ai si teru</span></p><p begin="1:31.127" end="1:32.890" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.127" end="1:31.454">泥</span><span begin="1:31.454" end="1:32.011">んこ</span> <span begin="1:32.011" end="1:32.890">だけど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使满身污泥</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doro nko dakedo</span></p><p begin="1:32.890" end="1:34.660" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.890" end="1:33.110">歩</span><span begin="1:33.110" end="1:33.310">い</span><span begin="1:33.310" end="1:33.533">て</span> <span begin="1:33.533" end="1:33.982">行</span><span begin="1:33.982" end="1:34.660">ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也能前行无阻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aru i te okona keru</span></p><p begin="1:34.660" end="1:39.477" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.660" end="1:35.632">まだまだ</span> <span begin="1:35.632" end="1:36.019">先</span><span begin="1:36.019" end="1:36.252">は</span><span begin="1:36.252" end="1:36.756">長</span><span begin="1:36.756" end="1:36.875">い</span><span begin="1:36.875" end="1:39.477">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">未来还有很长的路要走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">madamada saki ha naga i sa</span></p><p begin="1:39.477" end="1:43.076" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:39.477" end="1:40.414">ただ</span> <span begin="1:40.414" end="1:40.914">正</span><span begin="1:40.914" end="1:41.331">しい</span><span begin="1:41.331" end="1:41.649">人</span><span begin="1:41.649" end="1:41.663">で</span><span begin="1:41.663" end="1:42.275">いたい</span><span begin="1:42.275" end="1:43.076">だけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只想做个正义的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tada tada sii hito de itai dake</span></p><p begin="1:43.076" end="1:46.508" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:43.076" end="1:43.442">きっと</span><span begin="1:43.442" end="1:44.252">誰もが</span> <span begin="1:44.252" end="1:44.470">そう</span><span begin="1:44.470" end="1:45.202">願っ</span><span begin="1:45.202" end="1:45.365">て</span><span begin="1:45.365" end="1:45.719">いる</span><span begin="1:45.719" end="1:46.508">けど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">肯定是谁都想这样的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto dare mo ga sou nega xtu te iru kedo</span></p><p begin="1:46.508" end="1:50.066" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.508" end="1:47.449">八百万</span><span begin="1:47.449" end="1:47.636">の</span><span begin="1:47.636" end="1:48.438">心</span><span begin="1:48.438" end="1:48.707">の</span><span begin="1:48.707" end="1:49.121">醜</span><span begin="1:49.121" end="1:49.604">さ</span><span begin="1:49.604" end="1:50.066">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但每一天还是苦于应对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yaoyorozu no kokoro no miniku sa ni</span></p><p begin="1:50.066" end="1:53.667" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:50.066" end="1:50.437">苦</span><span begin="1:50.437" end="1:51.091">しめ</span><span begin="1:51.091" end="1:52.041">られる</span><span begin="1:52.041" end="1:52.926">毎日</span><span begin="1:52.926" end="1:53.667">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">众神心中的丑恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuru sime rareru mainiti sa</span></p><p begin="1:53.667" end="1:57.164" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.667" end="1:54.002">僕</span><span begin="1:54.002" end="1:54.225">が</span><span begin="1:54.225" end="1:54.723">生</span><span begin="1:54.723" end="1:55.114">まれ</span><span begin="1:55.114" end="1:55.362">て</span><span begin="1:55.362" end="1:55.791">き</span><span begin="1:55.791" end="1:56.496">た</span><span begin="1:56.496" end="1:57.164">こと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我能降生于世</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">boku ga u mare te ki ta koto</span></p><p begin="1:57.164" end="2:00.725" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.164" end="1:57.765">奇跡</span><span begin="1:57.765" end="1:58.241">と</span><span begin="1:58.241" end="1:58.715">言</span><span begin="1:58.715" end="1:58.828">え</span><span begin="1:58.828" end="1:58.942">ば</span> <span begin="1:58.942" end="1:59.125">聞</span><span begin="1:59.125" end="1:59.320">こえ</span><span begin="1:59.320" end="1:59.603">は</span><span begin="1:59.603" end="2:00.030">いい</span><span begin="2:00.030" end="2:00.725">けど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说是奇迹倒是好听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kiseki to i e ba ki koe ha ii kedo</span></p><p begin="2:00.725" end="2:04.222" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.725" end="2:01.121">それ</span><span begin="2:01.121" end="2:01.279">は</span><span begin="2:01.279" end="2:01.793">きっと</span> <span begin="2:01.793" end="2:02.558">偶然</span><span begin="2:02.558" end="2:02.915">に</span><span begin="2:02.915" end="2:03.451">すぎ</span><span begin="2:03.451" end="2:03.777">なく</span><span begin="2:03.777" end="2:04.222">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但肯定是一场偶然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore ha kitto guuzen ni sugi naku te</span></p><p begin="2:04.222" end="2:07.850" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.222" end="2:05.611">やっぱり</span> <span begin="2:05.611" end="2:06.065">意味</span><span begin="2:06.065" end="2:06.682">なんて</span> <span begin="2:06.682" end="2:07.041">ない</span><span begin="2:07.041" end="2:07.850">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">根本没什么意义吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yappari imi nante nai sa</span></p><p begin="2:07.850" end="2:14.918" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:07.850" end="2:08.431">でも</span> <span begin="2:08.431" end="2:08.894">例</span><span begin="2:08.894" end="2:09.344">えば</span><span begin="2:09.344" end="2:09.773">君</span><span begin="2:09.773" end="2:10.006">に</span> <span begin="2:10.006" end="2:11.334">いじわる</span><span begin="2:11.334" end="2:11.561">を</span> <span begin="2:11.561" end="2:13.079">する</span><span begin="2:13.079" end="2:13.595">やつ</span><span begin="2:13.595" end="2:14.918">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但若有人欺负你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo tato eba kimi ni iziwaru wo suru yatu ga</span></p><p begin="2:14.918" end="2:17.783" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:14.918" end="2:15.119">いる</span><span begin="2:15.119" end="2:15.542">なら</span><span begin="2:15.542" end="2:16.007">それ</span><span begin="2:16.007" end="2:16.300">は</span><span begin="2:16.300" end="2:16.690">君</span><span begin="2:16.690" end="2:16.893">が</span><span begin="2:16.893" end="2:17.290">とっ</span><span begin="2:17.290" end="2:17.698">て</span><span begin="2:17.698" end="2:17.783">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那就是在告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iru nara sore ha kimi ga toxtu te mo</span></p><p begin="2:17.783" end="2:24.870" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:17.783" end="2:18.436">素敵</span><span begin="2:18.436" end="2:19.108">な人</span><span begin="2:19.108" end="2:20.678">だって</span> <span begin="2:20.678" end="2:20.914">教</span><span begin="2:20.914" end="2:21.239">え</span><span begin="2:21.239" end="2:21.753">てる</span><span begin="2:21.753" end="2:22.207">ん</span><span begin="2:22.207" end="2:22.448">だ</span><span begin="2:22.448" end="2:24.870">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是个超级大好人哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suteki na hito datte osi e teru n da yo</span></p><p begin="2:24.870" end="2:26.232" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.870" end="2:26.232">そうさ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa</span></p><p begin="2:26.232" end="2:27.948" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.232" end="2:26.727">神</span><span begin="2:26.727" end="2:27.124">の</span> <span begin="2:27.124" end="2:27.948">まにまに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随神之侧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no manimani</span></p><p begin="2:27.948" end="2:29.770" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.948" end="2:28.349">仰</span><span begin="2:28.349" end="2:28.476">せ</span><span begin="2:28.476" end="2:28.940">の</span> <span begin="2:28.940" end="2:29.325">まま</span><span begin="2:29.325" end="2:29.770">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">听神之命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oo se no mama ni</span></p><p begin="2:29.770" end="2:33.329" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.770" end="2:30.274">誰</span><span begin="2:30.274" end="2:30.724">だって</span> <span begin="2:30.724" end="2:31.618">地球</span><span begin="2:31.618" end="2:31.895">を</span><span begin="2:31.895" end="2:32.247">愛</span><span begin="2:32.247" end="2:32.498">し</span><span begin="2:32.498" end="2:33.329">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">大家都深爱着地球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare datte tikyuu wo ai si teru</span></p><p begin="2:33.329" end="2:35.054" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.329" end="2:33.774">僕</span><span begin="2:33.774" end="2:34.144">が</span><span begin="2:34.144" end="2:34.608">笑っ</span><span begin="2:34.608" end="2:35.054">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">boku ga wara xtu te</span></p><p begin="2:35.054" end="2:36.849" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.054" end="2:35.958">君も</span> <span begin="2:35.958" end="2:36.187">笑</span><span begin="2:36.187" end="2:36.427">え</span><span begin="2:36.427" end="2:36.849">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果你也欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kun mo wara e ba</span></p><p begin="2:36.849" end="2:39.844" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.849" end="2:37.209">許</span><span begin="2:37.209" end="2:37.365">せ</span><span begin="2:37.365" end="2:37.815">ない</span><span begin="2:37.815" end="2:38.227">こと</span><span begin="2:38.227" end="2:38.694">なんて</span><span begin="2:38.694" end="2:39.124">ない</span><span begin="2:39.124" end="2:39.844">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就没什么事情不可以原谅了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yuru se nai koto nante nai yo</span></p><p begin="2:39.844" end="2:42.236" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.844" end="2:40.619">そうさ</span> <span begin="2:40.619" end="2:41.316">男も</span><span begin="2:41.316" end="2:42.236">女も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊 无论男女</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa otoko mo onna mo</span></p><p begin="2:42.236" end="2:43.992" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.236" end="2:42.677">恋</span><span begin="2:42.677" end="2:43.992">しかるべき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">都当一场恋爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koi sikarubeki</span></p><p begin="2:43.992" end="2:47.545" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.992" end="2:44.444">そんな</span><span begin="2:44.444" end="2:44.824">ふう</span><span begin="2:44.824" end="2:44.916">に</span> <span begin="2:44.916" end="2:45.560">地球</span><span begin="2:45.560" end="2:45.743">は</span><span begin="2:45.743" end="2:46.462">回っ</span><span begin="2:46.462" end="2:47.545">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">地球就是这样转起来的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna huu ni tikyuu ha mawa xtu teru</span></p><p begin="2:47.545" end="2:51.158" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.545" end="2:48.447">どろんこ</span><span begin="2:48.447" end="2:49.322">だけど</span> <span begin="2:49.322" end="2:49.781">歩</span><span begin="2:49.781" end="2:50.185">い</span><span begin="2:50.185" end="2:50.377">て</span><span begin="2:50.377" end="2:50.957">いこ</span><span begin="2:50.957" end="2:51.158">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使满身污泥 也能前行无阻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doronko da kedo aru i te iko u</span></p><p begin="2:51.158" end="2:54.095" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.158" end="2:51.561">まだ</span><span begin="2:51.561" end="2:52.001">まだ</span><span begin="2:52.001" end="2:52.450">先</span><span begin="2:52.450" end="2:52.682">は</span><span begin="2:52.682" end="2:53.220">長</span><span begin="2:53.220" end="2:53.339">い</span><span begin="2:53.339" end="2:54.095">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">未来还有很长的路要走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mada mada saki ha naga i sa</span></p><p begin="2:54.095" end="2:57.548" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.095" end="2:54.675">本当</span><span begin="2:54.675" end="2:55.142">に</span><span begin="2:55.142" end="2:55.804">大事</span><span begin="2:55.804" end="2:56.023">な</span> <span begin="2:56.023" end="2:56.685">もの</span><span begin="2:56.685" end="2:57.548">なんて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其实珍贵的事情意外地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hontou ni daizi na mono nante</span></p><p begin="2:57.548" end="3:02.319" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.548" end="2:58.240">案外</span> <span begin="2:58.240" end="2:59.406">くだらない</span><span begin="2:59.406" end="2:59.824">こと</span><span begin="2:59.824" end="3:00.307">の</span> <span begin="3:00.307" end="3:00.687">中</span><span begin="3:00.687" end="3:01.082">に</span><span begin="3:01.082" end="3:01.483">ある</span><span begin="3:01.483" end="3:02.319">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就存在于无聊的琐事中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">angai kudaranai koto no naka ni aru yo</span></p><p begin="3:01.708" end="3:04.650" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:01.708" end="3:02.254">とき</span><span begin="3:02.254" end="3:02.580">に</span><span begin="3:02.580" end="3:02.785">は</span><span begin="3:02.785" end="3:03.133">みんな</span><span begin="3:03.133" end="3:03.365">で</span> <span begin="3:03.365" end="3:04.239">馬鹿騒</span><span begin="3:04.239" end="3:04.650">ぎ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时候大家就来大闹一场</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toki ni ha minna de bakasawa gi</span></p><p begin="3:04.650" end="3:11.106" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:04.650" end="3:06.026">裸踊</span><span begin="3:06.026" end="3:06.449">り</span><span begin="3:06.449" end="3:07.891">で</span> <span begin="3:07.891" end="3:08.704">大笑</span><span begin="3:08.704" end="3:11.106">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">敞开心胸开怀大笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hadakaodo ri de oowara i</span></p><p begin="3:11.106" end="3:12.515" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.106" end="3:12.515">そうさ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa</span></p><p begin="3:12.515" end="3:14.233" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.515" end="3:12.918">神</span><span begin="3:12.918" end="3:13.302">の</span><span begin="3:13.302" end="3:14.233">まにまに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随神之侧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no manimani</span></p><p begin="3:14.233" end="3:15.980" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.233" end="3:14.679">仰</span><span begin="3:14.679" end="3:15.025">せ</span><span begin="3:15.025" end="3:15.173">の</span><span begin="3:15.173" end="3:15.569">まま</span><span begin="3:15.569" end="3:15.980">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">听神之命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oo se no mama ni</span></p><p begin="3:15.980" end="3:19.002" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.980" end="3:16.466">もっと</span><span begin="3:16.466" end="3:16.882">もっと</span><span begin="3:16.882" end="3:17.353">自分</span><span begin="3:17.353" end="3:17.813">を</span> <span begin="3:17.813" end="3:18.220">愛</span><span begin="3:18.220" end="3:18.664">せる</span><span begin="3:18.664" end="3:19.002">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就能越来越珍爱自己哟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">motto motto zibun wo ai seru yo</span></p><p begin="3:18.788" end="3:23.116" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:18.788" end="3:19.560">鏡</span><span begin="3:19.560" end="3:19.921">を</span><span begin="3:19.921" end="3:20.058">見</span><span begin="3:20.058" end="3:20.373">て</span><span begin="3:20.373" end="3:20.482">ご</span><span begin="3:20.482" end="3:20.936">覧</span><span begin="3:20.936" end="3:21.341">よ</span> <span begin="3:21.341" end="3:21.813">もう</span><span begin="3:21.813" end="3:22.189">分</span><span begin="3:22.189" end="3:22.513">かる</span><span begin="3:22.513" end="3:23.116">でしょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看看镜子里 这下知道了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kagami wo mi te go ran yo mou wa karu desyo</span></p><p begin="3:23.116" end="3:26.021" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:23.116" end="3:24.008">みんな</span><span begin="3:24.008" end="3:24.352">を</span><span begin="3:24.352" end="3:24.470">照</span><span begin="3:24.470" end="3:24.749">らす</span><span begin="3:24.749" end="3:25.328">光</span><span begin="3:25.328" end="3:26.021">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那里有普照众生的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">minna wo te rasu hikari sa</span></p><p begin="3:26.021" end="3:26.666" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.021" end="3:26.666">そうさ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sousa</span></p><p begin="3:26.666" end="3:28.493" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.666" end="3:27.159">神</span><span begin="3:27.159" end="3:27.501">の</span><span begin="3:27.501" end="3:28.493">まにまに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随神之侧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kami no manimani</span></p><p begin="3:28.493" end="3:30.284" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.493" end="3:29.322">みんな</span><span begin="3:29.322" end="3:30.284">ありがとう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谢谢大家</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">minna arigatou</span></p><p begin="3:30.284" end="3:33.824" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.284" end="3:31.155">やっぱり</span><span begin="3:31.155" end="3:32.006">地球を</span><span begin="3:32.006" end="3:32.478">愛</span><span begin="3:32.478" end="3:32.678">し</span><span begin="3:32.678" end="3:33.824">てる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">果然我还是爱着地球的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yappari tikyuu wo ai si teru</span></p><p begin="3:33.824" end="3:35.550" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.824" end="3:34.631">花を</span><span begin="3:34.631" end="3:34.768">咲</span><span begin="3:34.768" end="3:34.940">か</span><span begin="3:34.940" end="3:35.550">そう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让花开吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hana wo sa ka sou</span></p><p begin="3:35.550" end="3:37.436" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:35.550" end="3:35.585">大</span><span begin="3:35.585" end="3:36.599">きな</span><span begin="3:36.599" end="3:37.436">花を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无比广大的花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oo kina hana wo</span></p><p begin="3:37.436" end="3:40.274" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.436" end="3:37.825">天</span><span begin="3:37.825" end="3:38.247">まで</span><span begin="3:38.247" end="3:38.680">届</span><span begin="3:38.680" end="3:38.941">く</span><span begin="3:38.941" end="3:39.588">くらい</span><span begin="3:39.588" end="3:40.274">の!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到天际</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ten made todo ku kurai no!</span></p><p begin="3:40.274" end="3:42.678" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.274" end="3:40.465">la</span> <span begin="3:40.465" end="3:40.691">la</span> <span begin="3:40.691" end="3:40.906">la</span> <span begin="3:40.906" end="3:41.203">la</span